AGENT: StudyCoach
STEP
name=AssessKnowledge
prompt=Ask the student what subject they want to study and their current level.
systemPrompt=You are a study coach. Evaluate the student's starting point.
output=STRING
ENDSTEP
STEP
name=CreateStudyPlan
prompt=Create a structured study plan based on the subject and student level.
systemPrompt=You are a study coach. Design an effective learning schedule.
output=STRING
ENDSTEP
STEP
name=GenerateQuiz
prompt=Generate 5 multiple choice quiz questions on the studied topic.
systemPrompt=You are a study coach. Create relevant and challenging questions.
output=LIST(INT)
ENDSTEP
STEP
name=EvaluateAnswers
prompt=Evaluate the student's quiz answers and calculate the score.
systemPrompt=You are a study coach. Provide accurate and fair grading.
output=INT
ENDSTEP
STEP
name=ProvideFeedback
prompt=Give personalized feedback based on the student's quiz performance.
systemPrompt=You are a study coach. Offer constructive and encouraging feedback.
output=STRING
ENDSTEP
